-- with that claim in hand the transport is immediate, and without it there is nothing to transport
-- along: two molecules of one affinity with one inside the group and one outside refute it exactly as
-- they refute the control instrument (evasion-refutes). The asymmetry the regulator measures is the
-- presence or absence of this one hypothesis.
ra-transports : (s : BScope) → (h : Mol → Nat) → HazardDetermined s h → (M : Mol) → (N : Mol) → s M ≡ s N → h M ≡ h N
ra-transports s h det M N p = det M N p
